Package: ausrooftop
Title: Australian Rooftop Solar Generation Data
Version: 0.0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Thanh Cuong", "Nguyen", , "tngu0478@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The package provides a dataset of rooftop solar generation in Australia. The data is collected from the Australian Energy Market Operator (AEMO). The dataset includes the rooftop solar generation data output as well as the total operational demand of the system.
